      "text": "matlab ab hume karna hai jo chije badl rhi hai usko robot class mese bahar\nnikaal dena chhaiye and jo chije nhi badl rhi usko rehne dena chahiye\nnikaal ne wali chije: walk(), talk(), fly() \nkyunki wo vary ho rhi hai\n\nisse hum adhi definition cover kar lenge",
