      "originalText": "Yaha jese humne composition robot k liye inheritance use kiya kal ko dusre robot aaye jisi wajah se hume inheritance use karna padega so hum usko bhi robot class se remove karke baaki ki tarah abstract class banake kar skte hai(e.g. projection class then usme hum child class me define kar denge logic)",
